{
  "root_cause": "The import map lacks an entry for the checkboxes module specifier used in the script (`./packages/nhsuk-frontend/src/nhsuk/components/checkboxes/checkboxes.js`), causing the module to fail to load and the exclusive checkbox behavior to not initialize.",
  "repair_strategy": "Add the missing import map entry for the relative specifier `./packages/nhsuk-frontend/src/nhsuk/components/checkboxes/checkboxes.js` to map to the absolute path of the module, allowing initCheckboxes() to run and apply exclusive group behavior.",
